# ek-testdrive: build a 4-point course in the 64DD COURSE EDIT mode
# and TEST DRIVE it twice (S5b, o3dsek-plan.md section 6).
#
# EXPANSION-KIT-ONLY AND DISK-ONLY, exactly as ek-courseedit.gdxs explains:
# main_menu.c:222's EK arm bounces the cursor off MODE_COURSE_EDIT (4)
# whenever gLeoDriveConnectionState == 0. NOT a corpus replay; SHOTs are
# hand-placed. Menu walk = ek-widgetdrop.gdxs (the editor is up by 1100).
#
# Derivation (decomp/src/overlays/course_edit/, all at editor init):
#  - cursor starts at (160, 120)                          188850.c:47
#  - the stick is remapped every tick (func_xk2_800D6D90, 188850.c:75):
#    radius - 16.97 deadzone, clamp 49, x 64/49. Raw 48 on ONE axis ->
#    40, and 40^2 = 1600 is not > 1600, so the speed stays 0.15 and the
#    step is 0.15 * 40 / 2 = 3 px/tick exactly (188850.c:877-1010).
#    +X right, +Y up (y - 3). Never diagonal.
#  - gCreateOption COURSE + gPointOption SET at init: A in the 3D view
#    (y >= 56, off the icon box) places a point after the current one
#    (func_xk2_800DC67C, 188850.c:2073); the ring closes by itself.
#  - A reads LAST tick's world position (func_xk2_800F1938), so the
#    cursor rests >= 1 tick before every A.
#  - corners (100,75) (220,75) (220,165) (100,165) ~ (+-8750, 0, +-6550):
#    length ~61000 (3000..250000), no edge within 150, inside +-15000.
#  - icon 0 = TEST RUN, x [232,248) y [204,220) (191080.c:2989); A on
#    it starts the run one tick after the hover (func_xk2_800DEE20).
#  - in the run: hold A to accelerate (racer.c:4173); control ~60 ticks
#    after the start (gRaceIntroTimer 100 -> 40). START pauses; DOWN + A
#    on QUIT returns to the editor (func_xk2_800EC91C). The cursor stays
#    on icon 0, so A runs the same course again: Course_Init re-bakes.
build native-ek-testdrive
seed1 0x1234abcd
seed2 0x0fedcba9
pins det=1
note four corners at 3 px/tick, then two test runs of the course.
at 350
wait 1
at 400
press START 15 0
at 600
wait 1
shot menu_before
at 660
press DOWN 12 0
at 760
wait 1
shot menu_cursor
at 820
press A 12 0
at 1100
wait 1
shot editor
at 1200
stick -48 0 48
stick 0 48 36
wait 8
press A 6 20
shot point_1
stick 48 0 96
wait 8
press A 6 20
shot point_2
stick 0 -48 72
wait 8
press A 6 20
shot point_3
stick -48 0 96
wait 8
press A 6 30
shot point_4
stick 0 -48 100
stick 48 0 170
stick -48 0 44
wait 10
shot hover_testrun
press A 6 0
wait 40
shot run1_intro
wait 30
hold A 100
shot run1_drive_0
hold A 100
shot run1_drive_1
hold A 100
shot run1_drive_2
hold A 100
shot run1_drive_3
hold A 100
shot run1_drive_4
hold A 100
press START 6 20
shot run1_paused
press DOWN 6 10
press A 6 60
shot back_editor
wait 20
press A 6 0
wait 40
shot run2_intro
wait 30
hold A 100
shot run2_drive_0
hold A 100
shot run2_drive_1
hold A 100
shot run2_drive_2
hold A 60
wait 1
len 3900
